et j = null; try { j = await r.json(); } catch {}\n         if (!r.ok || !j || j.ok !== true) { console.log(JSON.stringify({wakeAgent:true, data:{reason:\"backend_down\", http:r.status, body:j}})); }\n         else { console.log(JSON.stringify({wakeAgent:false, data:{entered:j.funnel && j.funnel.entered}})); }\n       } catch(e) { console.log(JSON.stringify({wakeAgent:true, data:{reason:\"fetch_failed\", error:String(e)}})); }\n     '\n     ```\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - **md file unviewable:** Elia (#29486) couldn't open the AgentForboarding_v1.md attachment and wanted it at landing-page design quality. Fixed by rebuilding as a deployed HTML page.\n   - **First Vercel deploy output truncated:** re-ran the deploy command filtering for `https://|error|Production`, captured the Production URL and confirmed alias to nanohubdemo.vercel.app, then verified /agentforboarding.html → 200.\n   - **ncl config get without --id failed:** `error (handler-error): --id is required` — Daniela's cli_scope is \"global\", so I must pass `--id ag-1780401001748-zriukn`. Fixed by always including --id.\n   - **User feedback (CRITICAL, on Codex):** \"את כותבת לי הודעות ארוכות שאין לי סבלנות לקרוא... הרבה ובבולטים וזה ממש חופר... תנסי להיות סוכנת... יותר אנושית ומטומצתת ולא יותר מדי בולטים\" — write more human, condensed, fewer bullets. Applied to all subsequent messages.\n   - **Standing preferences reinforced/preserved:** copy-paste content ALWAYS in clearly-separated Q:/A: blocks (never buried in prose); ultra-concise; always Hebrew; never start messages with his name; no duplicate delivery across mid-turn send + final; no file-send narration; every response wrapped in <message> blocks.\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - **Uptime monitor** built, tested (returned {wakeAgent:false, entered:23}), and scheduled (task-1784029437567-kfrpq3, */5 cron, wakeAgent:true only on failure, wake-prompt to alert Elia + hand Claude Code a diagnostic).\n   - **Model-cost strategy** established: Daniela stay